Subject: [PATCH 1228/3799] soh: rename func_808B37AC -> BgSpot12Saku_DoNothing

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the empty terminal action installed once the gate is open.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot12_Saku/z_bg_spot12_saku.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot12_Saku/z_bg_spot12_saku.c  | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot12_Saku/z_bg_spot12_saku.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot12_Saku/z_bg_spot12_saku.c
